KG42.register("clusters-469a43cf787314a8f7211fc3",{"id":"04-energy_collectives::v142-d-K002","paper":"04-energy_collectives","label":"Trading permissions for members' electricity surpluses and deficits and conservation in exchanges","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K002","label":"Trading permissions for members' electricity surpluses and deficits and conservation in exchanges","market_meaning":"Collective members may exchange energy within the community according to their energy shortfalls or electricity surpluses and may participate in external imports and exports; traded quantities must satisfy member feasibility and internal and external aggregate balances. This cluster is limited to participation permissions and exchange quantities in the model and does not assert that an actual delivery process has been established.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["activation","participation","clearing"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"R006 represents the demand-side role of collective members, while R007 represents members' prosumer role, which can involve either supply or demand; the two are not equated with the same participant type. Only the exchange-feasibility part of R001 is shared; ADMM and the conditions of the 24-hour case do not become additional admission conditions for all trades.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"Participant roles, tradable products, and quantity conservation jointly form a trading-permission rule with independent significance. There is overlap with the clearing cluster at the quantity level, but participation permission is not another set of optimization objectives or an additional clearing rule.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R005","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides permissions for trading within and outside the community and the corresponding exchange balances."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Retains members' demand-side participation role in meeting energy shortfalls."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Retains prosumers' participation role in sharing electricity surpluses and deficits."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R009","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Specifies the internal exchange quantities corresponding to community energy products; the repeated balance is not counted as an additional rule."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"shared","role":"support","rationale":"Cites only the technical feasible region and quantity constraints of the same exchange problem; its primary assignment remains with the clearing cluster."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-C01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"Members' permission to meet electricity shortfalls complements community trading activities; no new admission conditions for pure consumers are inferred."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-C02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"As trading entities, prosumers address their electricity surpluses and deficits through internal exchanges and external imports and exports; this is a correspondence in the scope of activities, not an additional execution-order relationship."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-C03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R009::x::v141-c-R009-x-q_j","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-q_j","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The product chain and the trading chain use the same quantities for exchanges within the community and the same aggregate conservation condition, while retaining their respective product and trading roles."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-C04","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C005"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The trading chain restates the exchange part of the clearing constraints item by item, while R001 also includes the feasible region for net production. Their scopes are complementary and partially overlapping; the entire constraint package cannot be treated as a fully duplicate object."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M01","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X001","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-p_j"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The same member net production quantity is used for allocation feasibility and exchange balance, respectively."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M02","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X002","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-q_j","v141-c-R009::x::v141-c-R009-x-q_j"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"References to the same internal exchange quantity in the clearing, trading, and product chains; the domain descriptions of each chain are retained unchanged."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M03","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X003","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-alpha_j"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The same external import quantity for a member, without rewriting its clearing and trading roles."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M04","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X004","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-beta_j"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The same external export quantity for a member, linked in parallel according to the original local objects."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M05","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X005","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-q_imp"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The identical definition of the aggregation of individual imports supports the correspondence of total import quantities."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M06","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X006","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-q_exp"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The identical definition of the aggregation of individual exports supports the correspondence of total export quantities."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M07","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-P001","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-n","v141-c-R009::theta::v141-c-R009-theta-n"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E09"],"rationale":"Jointly indexes the members of the same collective, while retaining each chain's parameter references."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M08","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The zero-sum condition recurs under the same mechanism, member set, and scope of internal exchanges; only the display of this mathematical condition is unified, and the product description remains accessible."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G01","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"E04 and E08 directly describe prosumer collectives and members' electricity surpluses and deficits, without separately defining admission eligibility for pure consumers. This cluster limits R006 to members' demand-side role and retains its distinction from R007.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R007"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::V::participation.consumer","v141-c-R007::V::participation.prosumer"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g01-E08"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"If a separate consumer admission rule is needed, add a source that explicitly defines entity eligibility and have C confirm the role interpretation; do not merge the two nodes at present."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G02","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The activation label and exchange equations are insufficient to describe actual delivery, metering, execution confirmation, or default handling; these processes are outside the scope of the permissions and quantities assembled in this cluster.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R005::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g01-E10"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Evidence of execution under the same mechanism and the corresponding C chain need to be added only when extending to actual delivery rules; clearing equations cannot substitute for proof of delivery."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G03","category":"unverified_source","description":"The evidence used for participation permissions and exchange constraints remains unverified; assembled indicates only that candidate assembly is established within the specified scope.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R005","v141-c-R006","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E10"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Subsequently, manually check the entity terminology, exchange quantity definitions, and equation transcriptions, retaining the original statement that the units are unknown."}]},"rule_refs":["04-energy_collectives::v141-c-R005","04-energy_collectives::v141-c-R006","04-energy_collectives::v141-c-R007","04-energy_collectives::v141-c-R009","04-energy_collectives::v141-c-R001"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-7f5e3dcddfa1014c","COMP-dfd0de19f78ef557","COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","KG31-3fa7c9f6716d2240","KG40-f19328f0aeb3d626"]});
